Research market data
--------------------

The stock-quote skill can read A-share and Hong Kong quotes through
replaceable providers. None of these prints are an official exchange feed.
Records are tagged source_class=data (evidence tier 80).

- AKShare (https://github.com/akfamily/akshare), MIT License.
  Copyright AKFamily. Optional extra `deerflow-harness[akshare]`; not
  required for the default install. Quotes are scraped vendor data.
  Required transitive packages reviewed for this extra use MIT, BSD,
  Apache-2.0, ISC, or MPL-2.0 terms (including certifi under MPL-2.0 and
  tqdm under MIT AND MPL-2.0). This repository does not add an AGPL
  dependency for quotes.

- Tencent delayed quotes use the unofficial public endpoint
  https://qt.gtimg.cn. That endpoint is not a licensed market-data feed.
  Prints may be delayed.

- Tushare Pro is not installed and is disabled by default. It requires a
  token and credits and is not fully open data.
